  "description": {
    "text": "In 2009 the Gym Challenge events of Japan's Official Pokémon Card Gyms gave out holo basic Energy cards with promo numbers, 022 to 029/DPt-P, with SP Energy and Rainbow Energy, in place of the stamped Energies of earlier years; SP Energy had first come with the March tournaments that launched Beat of the Frontier. From June players got Porygon-Z G, carrying a banner for Advent of Arceus, and that expansion's July launch tournaments gave every player Beginning Door, winning players Pichu and the top finishers Mothim, all three with its logo.\n\nIn September players got Feraligatr 002/L-P, with a banner for the coming LEGEND series, and from then the L-P set's holo Energies, 011 to 018/L-P, replaced the DPt-P ones. From November gold, silver and bronze Victory Medals showing Pikachu, 033, 032 and 031/L-P, went to each tournament's first, second and third.",
